{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "157", "x": 0.895551985636664, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03819126296697169, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "purposes. It's been proposed that facilities could be provided for displaying", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.7715419537749841, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "projects related to various kinds of art that have been produced by local", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14841061289869437, "w": 0.771478490828579, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "people. For example, in the city of Paris during the summer months of July", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.1730327992034449, "w": 0.7714565504884647, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and August, all the traffic is banned from the roads by the sides of the river", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19750666499284275, "w": 0.7717388016862894, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and the banks are transformed into beaches where people can relax in", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.22212885129759327, "w": 0.7764637667073383, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "deck chairs under potted palm. trees, sunbathe, or buy a drink or a snack", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.24660279252977613, "w": 0.7712606253017438, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "while enjoying the view. But to make the most of our rivers in our increasingly", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2712620212419723, "w": 0.7720674966881876, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "crowded cities, we need to allow them to regain their original purpose and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2957359624741552, "w": 0.7714566530134186, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "be used as a means of transport, reclaiming our streets from cars and lorries.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.32035812991820944, "w": 0.771543594174245, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "To do this, we'll have to shift more traffic back to the river, but this time", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3448319957076073, "w": 0.7711519488507107, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cleanly and silently making the most of modern technology. Already more", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.7715486178969815, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "than 2 billion passengers use the ferry to travel in cities around the world", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3939280855231482, "w": 0.771478490828579, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "like Istanbul, San Francisco, and New York. And these numbers are set to", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.41855030954929123, "w": 0.7714350202481658, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "rise further. Admittedly, it's not a fast way of traveling, but neither is a car", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.44302417533868904, "w": 0.7716719554164087, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "when it's stuck in traffic. Of course, passenger traffic on roads might", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4676711068769267, "w": 0.7714129773830977, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "decrease as more people start working from home, but another Recent", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.49214497266632456, "w": 0.7714348151982582, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "development. The huge rise in online shopping has meant that another form", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5166188761771149, "w": 0.7721986261041041, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of urban traffic just keeps on growing and that's deliveries. Trucks and vans", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5412410624818654, "w": 0.7716524756751858, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in the city pollute and double park while dropping off parcels. Imagine using", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5657149659926558, "w": 0.7715654319894055, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the immense capacity of shipping to take these trucks off the road. One", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5903371522974064, "w": 0.7713696093276383, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "freight barge can replace 44 large trucks, uses far less energy, and causes", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6148110558081967, "w": 0.7716492974016178, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "less pollution. When the barge docks at the riverside. The parcels could be", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6394332798343397, "w": 0.7712823605919503, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "taken the last few kilometers to their final destination on cargo bikes,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6639441880311833, "w": 0.7713913446178449, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "electric ones. Of course, this is already happening in the Dutch city of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6885664497787187, "w": 0.7720849259303345, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Amsterdam. And in future, the final stage could even be carried out by drone,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7130403155681166, "w": 0.7714782857786714, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "although at present this isn't allowed. Wouldn't it be great to unblock our", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7376625018728672, "w": 0.7716309454348868, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "city centers in this way?", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.762136367662265, "w": 0.2542754699923301, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}